From 539f6cd659d3f8e60cf9092ef3c2ae4f45abca3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: telegdyd <telegdyd93@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:22:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] jasmine-j0024: file access to the iOS root over USB Ethernet
 (port 5142)

bsd/dev/sweet_netfs.c: a TCP server started with the USB Ethernet gadget,
one request per connection, kernel credentials: PUT (with mode, owner,
parent directories; unlink + create + fsync), GET, LS, MKDIR, RM. For
pushing builds into the root and pulling logs without reflashing userdata
(tools/sweet-fs.py). sweetusbfs=0 disables it.
---
